Try to avoid PulseAudio at this moment in order to simplify the test.

And, test the headphone without model option, too.  With nofixup model
option, the COEF setup is skipped, and this might influence on the
audio output.

If nothing helps, you need to play with hda_analyzer what pin actually
corresponds to which output.  Start with the old kernel, run
hda_analyzer and try to disable each pin by clearing the pin control.
The node 0x0f seems like the primary output pin, but I'm not sure
whether this corresponds to both speaker and headphone outputs.


